id: pm-github-ullj
title: Refresh only already-linked GitHub items without importing new ones
description: "Select explicit existing provenance, fetch linked issue numbers in GraphQL batches, reuse import lifecycle mapping, and apply audited update-only SDK transactions. Prove selection, zero creation, real lifecycle dates, missing reasons, dry-run immutability, and batch splitting."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: changelog-unreleased,github,refresh
created_at: "2026-10-19T16:13:56.599Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T18:49:27.424Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[19]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T16:14:11.328Z",codex-agent,"Plan: reuse prepareGithubImport, source lifecycle projection and importGithubAtomic. Refresh selects explicit tag or github_url identities before transport, batches at 100, and supplies a guarded update-only transaction mode with native audit comments. Real tracker tests fake only HTTP; live acceptance uses scratch copies only."
  "2026-10-19T16:20:35.265Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses shared import preparation, shared source-metadata projection, and guarded SDK update transactions. Dry-run acceptance exposed that complete-list SDK reads populate runtime caches; preview reads now use disposable copies so the selected tracker is byte-identical. The pinned SDK exposes no cache-write suppression option; this SDK UX limitation will be reported in the final summary."
  "2026-10-19T16:28:14.213Z",codex-agent,"Live read-only acceptance used independent tracker copies and the built CLI with --dry-run --json. Repository unbraind/pm-cli: selected 42, updated 42, unchanged 0, missing 0, created 0; 5 entries include status changes. Repository unbraind/pm-csv: selected 1, updated 1, unchanged 0, missing 0, created 0; 1 includes a status change. These current copies differ from the incident estimate; source-metadata backfill accounts for many planned changes. No refresh writes were applied to either original tracker."
  "2026-10-19T16:28:31.208Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof for zero creation: in an isolated source copy, reverting only the update-only suppression of the deterministic import upsert made the real-tracker guard regression fail, exit 1: actual mutations create+update versus required update only. The production source was never reverted."
  "2026-10-19T16:29:03.523Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral selection revert proof: in an isolated source copy, removing repository scoping from tag selection made the real-tracker only-linked regression fail, exit 1: actual selected/updated count 2 versus required 1. Together with the deterministic-id create-guard mutation proof, both negative controls fail for the intended behavior; unchanged production functions pass the focused 3-test run."
  "2026-10-19T16:31:14.342Z",codex-agent,"PM CLI limitation: storing timeout_seconds on the linked test was refused because the declared >=2026.10.5 host range cannot guard item format 2. No host pin or format was changed. Run-time --timeout 600 provides the bounded execution budget without persisting that guarded metadata."
  "2026-10-19T16:41:36.760Z",codex-agent,"Verified linked acceptance command: pm test pm-github-ullj --run --progress --timeout 600 passed with exit 0; all 10 real-tracker tests passed, zero failed/skipped, no timeout. The bounded batch fixture uses the SDK imported-document writer with complete valid metadata, while all behavior under test uses the production refresh command and real SDK. Current source type checks and lint also pass."
  "2026-10-19T17:25:50.874Z",codex-agent,"Isolated-home npm run release:check passed, exit 0: 933/933 tests, zero failed/skipped, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across all 16 authored modules (10730/10730 lines and statements, 285/285 functions, 3353/3353 branches), zero production audit findings, zero duplication at the unchanged gate, changelog check and release-publish attestation passed. Refresh help now describes ascending linked-number selection rather than inheriting import-specific limit wording; built CLI help is asserted. The required Bun gate is running on the final source."
  "2026-10-19T17:34:59.872Z",codex-agent,"Read-only preview clarification: all 5 companion status changes are terminal-disposition corrections under the shared importer rules: 4 closed -> canceled and 1 canceled -> closed. There are no remaining active -> closed transitions in that copy. The single CSV status change is blocked -> closed. Aggregate updated counts include source-metadata and label/title backfill; no preview was applied."
  "2026-10-19T17:42:12.226Z",codex-agent,"Final validation: isolated-home bun run release:check passed, exit 0, with 933/933 tests and zero failures/skips. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100 across 16 authored modules: 10730/10730 lines and statements, 285/285 functions, 3352/3352 branches. npm and Bun packed the same artifact hash, 39b90c2008e82c607d39cbc1c1a06c68d8b588b0. Both production audits, unchanged duplication/privacy gates, changelog checks and attestation checks passed. Strict tracker health passed with no history drift; six existing stale-in-progress advisories remain outside this feature. Ready for PR Refresh already-linked GitHub items without importing new ones; keep this item in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-19T17:48:13.431Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator idempotency review: inspect field deltas on a fresh companion-tracker copy, preserve genuine source refreshes, normalize representation-only comparisons, and prove immediate second apply changes zero bytes and no history lines. Trace dry-run SDK cache writes without changing upstream. Run both unchanged full release gates and behavioral normalization revert proof before pushing."
  "2026-10-19T17:51:31.496Z",codex-agent,"Copy-only field audit reproduced 42 selected/42 updates: 5 disposition corrections and 37 non-status refreshes. All 37 backfill missing GitHub metadata and genuine source creation dates; 34 also fill closure lifecycle/reason, 14 change tags, 7 change titles. Example issue 450: created_at 2026-08-22T17:04:29.745Z -> 2026-07-05T16:07:39Z; github_updated_at absent -> 2026-08-22T18:43:12Z; closed_at absent -> 2026-08-22T18:43:12Z. Preserve these genuine refreshes. Direct listAllComplete({includeBody:true}, {pmRoot,cwd:pmRoot,noExtensions:true}) writes runtime/metadata-cache*.json and runtime/metadata-query-index.sqlite; isolated refresh dry-run changed zero files. Extend read isolation to no-op applies and normalize timestamp instants plus tag sets."
  "2026-10-19T17:52:38.352Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral normalization revert proof: an isolated source copy retains the real-tracker apply/reapply tests and cache isolation; removing only timestamp normalization makes both plain and atomic regressions fail on updated=1 versus required 0 (ERR_ASSERTION, exit 1). Restored normalization passes 2/2. Baseline live second apply reported 0 updates/42 unchanged but rewrote 8 SDK runtime cache files; isolating all planning reads fixes that byte-level defect. Built CLI cold-copy dry-run with zero fixture links exits 0 and changes zero files; the nonempty live preview also changes zero files. New regressions verify immediate byte identity, unchanged history lines, equivalent timestamp/tag/title representations, and genuine github_updated_at movement."
  "2026-10-19T17:55:48.458Z",codex-agent,"Tag audit correction: 14 of the 37 non-status entries initially had tag diffs, but 7 are REST/GraphQL bot-login spelling churn (codefactor-io[bot] versus codefactor-io), not label membership changes. Refresh now requests author.__typename and projects Bot logins to the REST spelling, suppressing those seven tag writes. The remaining seven tag diffs and seven title diffs are real content changes. All 37 still require genuine source metadata/creation backfill. The source finalizer now skips normalized no-op fields during real refreshes too. Superseded the first in-flight npm diagnostic after this finding; final-source gates will run from the start."
  "2026-10-19T17:58:47.338Z",codex-agent,"Final-source fresh-copy live proof passed: first atomic apply selected 42 and updated 42 with zero creates/missing. The immediate second apply reports updated=0, unchanged=42, created=0, missing=0. Buffer.equals compared all 2561 files under the copy tracker, with zero byte differences and no added/removed files; history stayed 6265 lines. No cache priming intervened. Only seven real tag membership changes remain; seven bot spelling deltas are suppressed. Linked suite passes 13/13 with zero failures/skips/cancellations. Bot-projection-only revert fails its real-tracker regression with ERR_ASSERTION; normalization-only revert fails both plain and atomic regressions. Both final full release gates are running on identical source in separate validation directories."
  "2026-10-19T18:01:28.649Z",codex-agent,"Built CLI nonempty dry-run proof passed on a fresh cold companion-tracker copy: pm github refresh unbraind/pm-cli --dry-run --json selected 42, planned 42 updates, created 0, missing 0, exited 0, and changed zero files including runtime files. Direct SDK list reads still populate caches; refresh confines those SDK writes to disposable planning copies. Source/test/config byte comparison between the npm and Bun gate directories matches all 112 files (SHA-256 e779570b70b85cc26817d501ce7544595e259296c03b72ec989bccfb2ce0668a). Full gates remain in progress; no upstream issue or review-thread action was made."
  "2026-10-19T18:10:46.624Z",codex-agent,"Implementation commit facc65b983d1a087a7e957f48864f65e18494b31 is source-complete. A fresh git clone --no-local checkout with a clean npm ci passes isolated-home pm health --strict-exit --json and pm validate --json, both ok=true. The implementation history remains append-only and no original companion tracker was refreshed. Both full release commands are still running; their final counters will be appended before the claim is released."
  "2026-10-19T18:44:52.358Z",codex-agent,"Built CLI apply/reapply proof also passed on a separate fresh companion-tracker copy. Exact command shape: pm --path PM_PATH github refresh unbraind/pm-cli --atomic --json, where PM_PATH selects only the scratch tracker. First apply: selected=42, updated=42, created=0, missing=0. Immediate second apply: selected=42, updated=0, unchanged=42, created=0, missing=0. Buffer.equals compared all 2587 regular files, including installed extension and runtime files; zero byte differences or file additions/removals. Total history line count is unchanged at 6265. No cache priming intervened. Full npm and Bun release gates are still progressing without reported test failures."
  "2026-10-19T18:49:26.094Z",codex-agent,"Final gates PASS at implementation source facc65b983d1a087a7e957f48864f65e18494b31: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each exit 0 with 936/936 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/TODOs, exact 100/100/100/100 across all 16 authored modules. Each covers 10742/10742 lines and statements, 286/286 functions and 3371/3371 branches, zero skipped coverage. Thresholds, source inventory, dependency pins and duplication budgets unchanged; production audit, privacy, pack, changelog and publish-attestation gates pass. Linked suite passes 13/13. Normalization-only reverts fail 2/2 cases; bot-projection-only revert fails 1/1 as intended. Final built CLI fresh-copy apply/reapply is 42 updates then 0, with all 2587 files byte-identical and history unchanged at 6265 lines. Dry-run selects 42 and changes zero files. Direct SDK listAllComplete includeBody/noExtensions reads write runtime/metadata-cache JSON files and runtime/metadata-query-index.sqlite; all refresh planning reads isolate those SDK cache writes. No upstream report or review-thread action, no merge. Releasing the claim and leaving the item in_progress for orchestrator verification. Final receipt changes only documentation and append-only tracker evidence."
